To multiply these fractions, multiply the numerators together and the denominators together:

\[
\dfrac{1}{n} \times \dfrac{5}{6}
= \dfrac{1 \times 5}{n \times 6}
= \dfrac{5}{6n}
\]

So the simplified product is **\(\dfrac{5}{6n}\)**.

